### 6. **Event Listener Leak in File Watcher (backup.js) - Not Cleaned Up**

The backup system uses Chokidar file watchers (line 21 import) but I don't see them properly cleaned up in error paths. Lines 779-807 set up debounce/retry timers but no corresponding `.close()` call on the watcher if backup is disconnected. This causes file descriptor leaks.

